  "description": "Self-contained email monitoring, delivery tracking, and history dashboard for Umbraco 17 and 18. Wraps Umbraco's IEmailSender with a transparent decorator so all outgoing emails (system notifications, forgot password, invitations, form submissions, e-commerce orders) are automatically recorded with status, recipient breakdown, and errors. Backoffice dashboard under Settings provides volume metrics, recipient domain breakdown, full history search/filter, and retry/resend capability. Cross-database (SQL Server, SQLite, PostgreSQL). Self-wires completely with zero host Program.cs changes.",
